PREAMBLE

This Commercial Proprietary Software Licence Agreement ("Agreement") establishes the terms and conditions governing the access, installation, use, reproduction, distribution and protection of software developed, owned or legally controlled by SYNTARA Technologies, hereafter referred to as the "Licensor".

This Agreement applies to individuals, businesses, organisations and other entities obtaining access to software products distributed by SYNTARA Technologies.

By purchasing, downloading, installing, accessing or using the Software, the individual or organisation ("Licensee") acknowledges and agrees to the applicable terms of this Agreement.

Where acceptance is required by law, the Licensee must expressly accept these terms before the relevant licence becomes effective.

