3.3. The licence does not grant permission to reproduce, modify, redistribute or commercially exploit the underlying proprietary code beyond the rights expressly provided.

3.4. The Licensor may offer different licence categories, including personal, educational, professional, enterprise and institutional licences.

3.5. Each licence category may have separate pricing, usage restrictions and commercial permissions.

